WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:24.000
Shine!  Sage's Stone

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:36.280
Let's rest over there.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.490
Yeah.

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:47.640
It may be another lame trap.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.130
This place is...

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:03.600
It's our house.

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:13.110
It's the day Mokuba and I were brought here.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:22.480
Matter is made of atoms.  Atoms are made of a nucleus and electrons.

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:28.080
Seto, you wanted the Kaiba family to adopt you.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:33.420
So you have no time to sleep until you catch up with Gozaburo.

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:37.800
Or do you and Mokuba want to leave this estate?

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:39.810
I know!

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:47.810
Seto, tell me your vision for Kaiba Corporation.

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:53.820
If you inherit Kaiba Corporation, what do you want to do?

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:57.560
I want to build Kaiba Land.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.560
Kaiba Land?

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:06.570
My brother wants to create a game world where poor kids like us can play all the time.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:08.980
A game world?

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.260
How lame.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.570
That's your dream?

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.070
Games are not lame!

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:20.660
Games comfort weary hearts.

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:22.530
Mankind's wisdom created games!

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:23.600
And?

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.460
"And"?

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.090
And can games change the world?

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:32.100
You want to be Kaiba Corporation's successor.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:35.090
To become the king who rules the world!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.100
Hey.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:41.620
Take away all their games.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:42.640
Yes, sir.

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:47.110
I forbid you to play games until you master the ways of a king!

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.360
Unbelievable.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:56.240
After taking your games, you have nothing left.

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.680
We'll resume your lessons soon.

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:03.230
Big brother...

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:06.330
You're not wrong.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.130
What's the matter?

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:15.970
Well...

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:17.970
Give this to my brother.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:20.970
He forgot one of his books.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.980
You forgot this.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:35.260
You don't have time to sleep.

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:37.970
We'll resume your lessons in an hour.

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.350
I know.

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:54.330
Big brother, they didn't take my prized possession.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:57.080
Use these cards to relax.

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:01.370
Mokuba.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:07.490
All these weak cards.

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:10.490
Mokuba...

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:18.330
Mokuba, I promise to get the real version someday!

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:27.230
Such wonderful brotherly love.

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:30.840
Seto, you've also had a painful childhood.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:34.960
Why are you showing us these scenes?

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:40.850
I want you to remember how you drove Gozaburo Kaiba to death.

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:42.090
What?

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.820
You will eventually be punished.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:48.120
Noa, who are you?

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.830
Enjoy waiting for that moment.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:05:59.560
Anzu...

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:02.700
We've been moving randomly.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:05.340
We overlooked something important.

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:06.900
Something important?

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:09.000
This is a game.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:14.020
The door opens if we play a card that's stronger than the monster in the door.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.350
That's Rule #1.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:18.580
Rule #1...

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:19.730
I see!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:23.630
There's a second rule to escape this maze!

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:24.860
And it's probably...

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:26.500
The order!

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:28.370
I thought it was weird.

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:33.300
Each room had cards from Levels 1 to 4.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.560
Correct.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:38.160
It shows the order to escape from this endless loop.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:41.520
We kept going through the Level 1 door.

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:43.310
Then this time...

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:46.220
The Level 2 door!

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:50.250
Go, Celtic Guardian!

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:55.620
Good!

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:57.190
Just wait, Anzu!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.200
It's so cold...  Save me, Yugi.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:12.540
No matter how hard you call for your friends, this world is just for us.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:14.640
It's your turn.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.530
My turn!

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:24.340
I used Offerings to the Doomed last turn, so I can't draw this turn.

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:27.560
You only have one card in your hand.

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:34.060
If you don't summon a monster soon, my cute Flying Penguin will attack you directly.

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.450
Bring me out to the field.

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:40.140
A Deck Master can be Special Summoned to the field.

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.570
I will protect you.

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:45.530
Wait!  You don't have enough attack points to win!

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:49.600
If my Deck Master is destroyed, I instantly lose!

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:50.800
Exactly.

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:57.220
Without Dark Magician, Dark Magician Girl is a useless cosplayer!

00:07:58.280 --> 00:07:59.600
Don't worry.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:02.520
A time will come when I'll need your help.

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:04.230
No, there won't.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.420
I set a monster in defense position!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.350
I end my turn!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:15.100
So you had a monster to defend with.

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:16.740
My turn!

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:20.750
Go, Flying Penguin!

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:22.980
Penguin Sword!

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:31.220
A worthless angel.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:37.230
Due to Skelengel's effect, I draw a card from my deck!

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:45.080
I end my turn.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:50.140
Anzu Mazaki, 16 years old, you only have one card in your hand.

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:54.340
And your only hope is a failed magician.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:57.120
There's nothing you can do.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:09:00.810
I'll make good use of your body.

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:04.730
I won't let you!

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:08.910
Everything depends on this draw.

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:12.530
Lend me your strength, Yugi!

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:17.670
No good.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:19.870
1550 attack points.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:23.040
It's not strong enough to defeat his monster.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:28.050
Wait.  Maha Vailo is a great magician with a secret effect.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.800
A secret effect?

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.050
Oh yeah!  This card...

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:40.440
A card that's like me?

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.590
Yeah.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:45.590
If you have this many cards, there must be one.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.110
Hmm...

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:50.850
Dark Magician, of course!

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:54.600
Is what I want to say, but this card is more like my other self.

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:58.640
I think I'm like this card.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:02.700
Maha Vailo?

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:03.460
Yeah.

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:08.150
It's not a high-class monster nor does it have a lot of attack points.

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:12.970
But it has a secret effect and is surprisingly powerful.

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:16.170
Maha Vailo's secret effect...

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:18.160
I remember!

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:22.560
My turn!  I summon Maha Vailo!

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:27.170
And a spell card!

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:31.680
I equip it with Magic Formula!

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:39.940
Too bad, but Flying Penguin has 2200 attack points.

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:42.050
Your monster is weaker.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:45.720
Wrong.  Maha Vailo has a secret effect.

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:50.020
It gains 500 points for every Equip Card!

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.080
What?

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:56.420
Maha Vailo!  Holy Lightning!

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.940
We did it!  Thank you.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.480
Yugi.

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:40.690
I thought I heard Anzu.

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:42.220
What's wrong?

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.240
N-Nothing.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:55.970
Every time Anzu says my name, I wonder which one of us she's calling.

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:58.970
The answer is obvious, but...

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.110
Where's the Level 3 door?

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:06.440
There!

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:09.330
Good!

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.410
I'm counting on you, Gaia The Fierce Knight!

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:15.380
Wait, partner!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:24.500
Gaia!

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:27.280
Mirror Force.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.350
Like I thought.  Look above the door!

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:37.340
Can it be that they're set cards?

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:38.920
No doubt.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:40.700
In that case...

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:42.570
How's this?

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:52.380
Good.  I can win!

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:53.080
No!

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:03.120
I'm not done!  Berfomet!

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:05.980
And Polymerization!

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.500
Go, Chimera!

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:30.550
Nice!  It's the final door!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.540
Five set cards.

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:36.560
We used up a lot of cards to get here.

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:38.000
Be careful.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:42.800
If we run out of cards, we can't escape this maze.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:46.070
I only have five cards left.

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:49.450
A Level 4 monster and five set cards.

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:51.280
This will be tough.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:56.310
Wait!  That's only as a last resort!

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:57.400
In that case...

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:00.670
I play this!  Heavy Storm!

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:10.620
Nice!  All the set cards are gone!

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:16.420
What's your card?

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:21.870
4-Starred Ladybug of Doom!

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:37.500
All right!

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:38.890
Great idea.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:45.450
4-Starred Ladybug of Doom's effect destroys Level 4 monsters.

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:47.280
Let's hurry!

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:52.910
Anzu!

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:57.290
Anzu!  Anzu!

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:03.380
I underestimated you.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.880
You'll regret forcing me to take you seriously.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:08.600
My turn.

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:10.890
Bolt Penguin in defense position!

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:16.200
Then I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:22.040
There aren't many monsters that have more than 2550 attack points.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:23.630
I'll steamroll it!

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.140
My turn!

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.630
Maha Vailo attacks!

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.740
Holy Lightning!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.080
My chance has arrived!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:43.720
I activate the Quick-Play Spell Revenge Sacrifice!

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:50.560
Maha Vailo!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:55.560
Revenge Sacrifice tributes your monster that destroyed my monster.

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:59.070
I get to Special Summon a new monster!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:09.300
I summon Defender Iceberg!

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:12.550
2450 defense points?

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:17.040
Can you get past this monster to attack me?

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.050
My turn.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.860
I set a card.

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:25.200
I summon Penguin Torpedo.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:28.560
My Deck Master's ability powers it up!

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:38.910
Penguin Torpedo can attack you directly.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:43.150
Anzu!

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.150
Now it's your turn.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.390
My turn.

00:16:57.900 --> 00:17:00.120
We can't wait!  I'm coming out!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:05.900
I can't attack, but it's now harder for him to attack us.

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:08.140
Dark Magician Girl...

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:14.910
The useless one has shown up.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:18.680
But that defense won't work against me.

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:20.410
My turn.

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:24.780
I activate my set card, Ocean of Regeneration!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:32.420
This card resurrects Water Attribute monsters in my graveyard for one turn.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:35.430
Go!  Direct attack!

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:53.110
Oh no...

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:59.120
Anzu Mazaki, 16 years old, your life is like a candle in the wind!

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:01.660
Anzu!

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:05.940
Anzu is going to lose!

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:09.100
I've come this far, but I can't do anything?

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:11.100
Dammit!

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:16.940
No.  I believe in Dark Magician Girl's power.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.850
Listen carefully.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:25.110
There should be a card that can save us from this situation.

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:28.110
I don't have such a card in my deck.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:30.620
I didn't even choose Dark Magician.

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:32.760
Wrong.  You do have one.

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:35.040
It's the first card you chose.

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:40.840
Sage's Stone?

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:45.160
Yes.  That card will give me a miracle.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:48.630
But I don't know if I'll draw that card next turn.

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:53.570
I activate my Deck Master's ability!

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:58.880
My sleeping companion, lend me your strength.

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:02.250
Special black magic!

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:03.650
Soul Circle!

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.190
What?

00:19:13.850 --> 00:19:18.340
My Deck Master's ability lets me borrow the power of my friends in the graveyard.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:21.200
For each friend, I draw a card from my deck!

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:31.920
Here it is!

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:38.540
What?

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:41.750
I'll show you my power!

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:52.760
Dark Magician!

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:03.710
Dark Magician?

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.050
Dark Magician?

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.250
It can't be!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:17.460
Anzu Mazaki, 16 years old, doesn't have that card in her deck!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:25.700
As long as I'm on the field, Sage's Stone can bring my mentor Dark Magician for one turn.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:27.700
What?

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:28.880
Here we go!

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:30.540
Double Black Magic!

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:48.730
How dare you!  I was almost able to acquire a young body...

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.730
I won.

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:06.440
Anzu.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:09.560
Anzu!

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:13.800
Yugi.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:17.920
You did come to save me!

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:20.510
Yugi, I was so scared!

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:24.480
Anzu, you're safe now.

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:25.600
Yugi...

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:32.050
This was unexpected.

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:36.310
But it's an additional thing I can look forward to.

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:54.620
I defeated the weird penguin and reunited with Yugi, but how are the others doing?

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:57.730
What?  Jonouchi's duel has already started?

00:21:57.730 --> 00:22:00.080
The opponent's Deck Master is Judge Man.

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:02.970
What kind of duel is a "courtroom duel"?

00:22:02.970 --> 00:22:06.840
Be careful, Jonouchi!  It's dangerous to underestimate him!

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:10.310
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Deck Master Judge Man's Verdict

00:22:10.310 --> 00:22:11.820
Duel, standby!

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:23.620
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:23.620 --> 00:22:32.570
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:32.900 --> 00:22:37.540
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:41.510
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:49.480
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:53.050
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:57.820
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:57.820 --> 00:23:07.930
And walk it without stopping

00:23:07.930 --> 00:23:15.540
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:15.770 --> 00:23:24.510
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:24.510 --> 00:23:32.490
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:42.330
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
